id: pm-todos-neey
title: Pin pm toolchain to 2026.9.5 / changelog 2026.9.2
description: "Pin @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.5, pm-changelog 2026.9.2, and pm-ops 2026.9.5 so this repo runs the current published toolchain. The changelog-date control already asserts the unflagged heading differs from the flagged one, which holds for both the old clock-stamping generator and the 2026.9.2 undated heading."
type: Chore
status: closed
