author: pi-agent
resolution: "Pinned @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.5, pm-changelog 2026.9.2, and pm-ops 2026.9.5. The changelog-date control already asserted difference rather than clock form, so no verifier rewrite was required."
expected_result: "release:check and pm health --strict-exit both exit 0 against the current published toolchain."
actual_result: "release:check exit 0; pm health --strict-exit exit 0. Unflagged heading is '## 2026.1.2'; flagged heading is '## 2026.1.2 - 2026-01-02'."
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-05T18:00:35.379Z",pi-agent,"Pin only. No verifier source change: this repo already asserts that the unflagged heading differs from the flagged one.\n\nrelease:check exit 0. pm health --strict-exit exit 0.\n\nRevert-proof on test/verify-release-changelog-date.test.ts:\n- clock-derived control (old assertion) against pm-changelog 2026.9.2: 4 fail / 17 pass\n  live failure: without --date-from-version expected the clock-derived '## 2026.1.2 - 2026-09-05', got '## 2026.1.2'\n- restored property-based control: 21 pass / 0 fail\nThe identical-control case still fails, so the suite is not vacuous."
